title: LAPS Password Read
id: 087de317-e6b9-4521-bb35-56a01d546552
status: experimental
description: Detects reads of the LAPS local administrator password attribute (ms-Mcs-AdmPwd, event 4662 with the attribute GUID), which returns the plaintext local admin password; bulk or unusual reads indicate credential harvesting.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4662
    Properties|contains: 'ms-Mcs-AdmPwd'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - ObjectName
falsepositives:
  - Help desk retrieving local admin passwords
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.credential_access
  - attack.t1552
